== Effects ==
* Grants +2 [[Damage]] for the current room.

== Notes ==
* '''XV - The Devil''''s effect is identical to {{i|The Book of Belial}}.
** Unlike {{i|The Book of Belial}}, the card does not grant increased chances for {{r|Devil Room}}s / {{r|Angel Room}}s to appear after defeating a boss.

== Strategy ==
* Since this effect only lasts for a room, it is preferably used against a [[boss]].

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}} / {{i|The Book of Belial|r}} / {{dlc|r}}'''XV - The Devil''': The effects stack, every copy of the effect gives +1 damage.
* {{i|Blood of the Martyr}}: Also applies a temporary x1,5 damage multiplier.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}} / {{i|The Book of Belial|nr}} / {{dlc|nr}}'''XV - The Devil''': No effect.

